  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat age-based allowance rule does Shawna use to calculate her father's weekly allowance? Shawna's father is six times as old as Shawna. The allowance is paid weekly.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Let Shawna be \\(s\\) years old. Her father is\n\n\\[\n6s\n\\]\n\nyears old. If Shawna’s rule is to pay **one dollar per year of age each week**, then her father’s weekly allowance is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6s\\text{ per week}}\n\\]\n\n—that is, the father receives **six times Shawna’s weekly allowance**.",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Shawna's father is five times as old as Shawna.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Let Shawna’s age be \\(s\\) years. Her father is five times as old, so he is\n\n\\[\n5s\n\\]\n\nyears old.\n\nUsing the rule “\\(\\$1\\) per year of age each week,” her father’s weekly allowance is therefore\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$5s\\text{ per week}}\n\\]\n\nSo, her father receives **five times Shawna’s weekly allowance**.",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Shawna is four times as old as Aliya.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Let Aliya’s age be \\(a\\).\n\n- Shawna is four times as old as Aliya:\n  \\[\n  \\text{Shawna}=4a\n  \\]\n- Shawna’s father is five times as old as Shawna:\n  \\[\n  \\text{Father}=5(4a)=20a\n  \\]\n\nThus, Shawna’s father is **twenty times as old as Aliya**.\n\nHowever, the ages alone do not specify the allowance rule. If the rule is **\\(\\$1\\) per year of age per week**, then the father’s allowance would be\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$20a\\text{ per week}},\n\\]\n\nwhere \\(a\\) is Aliya’s age.",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Shawna is three times as old as Aliya.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Let Aliya’s age be \\(a\\).\n\n- Shawna is \\(3a\\) years old.\n- Shawna’s father is five times Shawna’s age:\n\n\\[\n5(3a)=15a\n\\]\n\nSo Shawna’s father is **15 times as old as Aliya**.\n\nIf the allowance rule is \\(\\$1\\) per year of age each week, then his weekly allowance is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$15a\\text{ per week}}\n\\]\n\nwhere \\(a\\) is Aliya’s age.",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Aliya is 3 years old.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Aliya is \\(3\\) years old.\n\n1. Shawna is three times Aliya’s age:\n   \\[\n   3 \\times 3 = 9\n   \\]\n   So Shawna is \\(9\\) years old.\n\n2. Shawna’s father is five times Shawna’s age:\n   \\[\n   5 \\times 9 = 45\n   \\]\n   So her father is \\(45\\) years old.\n\nTherefore, if Shawna gives **\\(\\$1\\) per year of age each week**, her father receives\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$45\\text{ per week}}\n\\]\n\nThe age-based rule is: **weekly allowance equals the person’s age in dollars.**",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: Shawna gives her father an allowance equal to 2 dollars for each year of his age.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Aliya is \\(3\\) years old.\n\n1. Shawna is three times Aliya’s age:\n   \\[\n   3 \\times 3=9\n   \\]\n   So Shawna is \\(9\\) years old.\n\n2. Her father is five times Shawna’s age:\n   \\[\n   5 \\times 9=45\n   \\]\n   So her father is \\(45\\) years old.\n\n3. Shawna gives him \\(\\$2\\) for each year of his age:\n   \\[\n   2 \\times 45=\\$90\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the age-based rule is **\\(\\$2\\) per year of age each week**, and her father receives\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$90\\text{ per week}}.\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How old is Shawna's father?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Aliya is \\(3\\) years old, and Shawna is three times as old:\n\n\\[\n3 \\times 3 = 9\n\\]\n\nShawna’s father is five times Shawna’s age:\n\n\\[\n5 \\times 9 = 45\n\\]\n\nTherefore, Shawna’s father is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{45\\text{ years old}}.\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
